cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Independent reproduction and external validation of image-based deep learning prognostic models for head and neck cancer"
abstract: >-
  Code, data, model weights, logs and results for an independent exact and
  statistical reproduction and external validation of the head and neck cancer
  prognostic models of Mateus et al. (2023), including a CLAIM and TRIPOD+AI
  reporting audit.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/qirail/reproducibility-hnc-cnn"
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - deep learning
  - head and neck cancer
  - medical imaging
  - CLAIM
  - TRIPOD+AI
